{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经sc.exe修改服务DACL。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Service DACL Modification via sc.exe。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经sc.exe修改服务DACL","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经sc.exe修改服务DACL\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://blogs.jpcert.or.jp/en/2024/07/mirrorface-attack-against-japanese-organisations.html","https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_sc_sdset_deny_service_access.yml","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/secauthz/sid-strings","https://www.sans.org/blog/red-team-tactics-hiding-windows-services/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"5188c68e-d3de-4e96-994d-9e242269446f","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  (process.name : \"sc.exe\" or ?process.pe.original_file_name : \"sc.exe\") and\n  process.args : \"sdset\" and process.args : \"*D;*\" and\n  process.args : (\"*;IU*\", \"*;SU*\", \"*;BA*\", \"*;SY*\", \"*;WD*\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1564","name":"Hide Artifacts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1564/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1543","name":"Create or Modify System Process","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1543.003","name":"Windows Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1543/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":210,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
